    },
    "Bonjour,\n\nJe souhaite vendre aux groupes de quartier sur LeGrenier.\n\nRaison sociale :\nType (ferme, coopérative, grossiste, boulangerie…) :\nQuartiers desservis :\n\nMerci !" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hello,\n\nI'd like to sell to neighbourhood groups on LeGrenier.\n\nBusiness name:\nType (farm, co-op, wholesaler, bakery…):\nNeighbourhoods served:\n\nThank you!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Bonjour,\n\nNotre organisme souhaite soutenir les groupes de quartier sur LeGrenier.\n\nNom de l'organisme :\nType (banque alimentaire, centre communautaire, fondation…) :\nQuartiers soutenus :\nPersonne-ressource et téléphone :\n\nMerci !" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Hello,\n\nOur organization would like to support neighbourhood groups on LeGrenier.\n\nOrganization name:\nType (food bank, community centre, foundation…):\nNeighbourhoods supported:\nContact person and phone number:\n\nThank you!"
          }
        }
      }
